  "translation": "Tura, wali, tettḥekkreḍ i yiman-ik ɣef tiqemmarin n wulim yerẓen-agi, ɣef Miṣrayim; win ara yesḥen fell-as, ad yekcem deg ufus-is, ad t-isexxer. Akken i tella teɣzi s Miṣrayim, iwakken ad yakken yal win i t-yeḥekkreḍ. Iwakken i d-yella Paraɛu, agellid n Miṣrayim, i wid akk i t-yeḥekkreḍ fell-as.",
